# LATOS File Structure

```
CONTEXT/INBOX/     ROSTER/          RESEARCH/        TASKS/
ORG/               JOB_CARDS/       EXPERTS/         SKILLS_TALENT/
EXPERTS_TALENT/    ROADMAP/         OPERATIONS/      PROMPTS/{TITLES,TEAMS,EXECUTION}/
FORECASTS/         ARCHIVE/         CALENDAR/        QA/              MEMORY/          REPORTS/
LATOS_STATE.md     .cursor/skills/  scripts/generate_latos_giga_pack.py
```

- Archive: never delete ancestors under `ARCHIVE/YYYY-MM-DD_HHMM/`
- Security paths (`LAYERS/`, `SECURITY_STATE.md`) — separate pack, same repo
- Org resize only via `scripts/generate_org.py` (600 assert)
